  "instrument": {
    "name": "Plectrum-mute demo",
    "description": "A compact 1-string plucked instrument on direct GPIO (no PCA) that demonstrates the global plucking config: the plectrum itself damps the string at Note Off (pluck.muteSource = plectrum, per-plucker muteUs) so no dedicated damper servo is needed, plus a fret->pluck settle delay.",
